  "$pve": "Round 05 (stream D, campaign): tower = stationary gun turret, hq = enemy headquarters (mission target, no gun). pve:true = never moves/respawns/regenerates; their 'ability' entry is a required placeholder that is never used. Numbers are Claude's first proposal — owner decides (rule 4).",
  "$charged": "Round 07 (owner 2026-10-11): shots charged to >= minCharge get a class special. Heavy: shell speed rises with charge up to speedAtFull tiles/s (laser), a direct hit sends a shock wave = ratio x shell damage to the hit tank's nearby enemies (not the hit tank, never allies) within radius tiles; if the hit destroys the tank, its wreck explodes for ratio x shell damage within radius. Standard: pierce = passes through the first tank and hits the next one for ratio x damage. Artillery: fire = a burning patch the size of the blast for duration s, enemies inside take ratioPerSec x landing damage per second (in tick-second chunks); fixed size, does not spread. minCharge 0.3 chosen by Claude (owner left it open)."
